{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15103320","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15103320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1510332001:0":{"text":"……あのトーテムの紋様は。","source_cn":"……那个图腾纹样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F2896AC92A5EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510332002:0":{"text":"見覚えがあるはずです。あれは<style=\"highlight\">豊穣神ゼドランの神の力を表す印</style>。スピロクタスは、豊穣神の眷族です。","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你应该再清楚不过了，那是<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF624D38F941A41B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510332003:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">あなたは、豊穣神に武器を授けられた選ばれし者</style>。その槍に神の力が宿っているからこそ、あなたは勝利を手にしてこられた……","source_cn":"<style=highlight>你是被丰饶神授予了武...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2437BA0E2561D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510332004:0":{"text":"ですが、同じく豊穣神の創造物である相手には、それも通じません。神が、自らの信徒に自分を殺す力を授けるはずがないでしょう。","source_cn":"但是，遇上同是丰饶神所创之物，它就会失去效用。神……不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6DB88311B7A025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1510332004":{"text":"ですが、同じく豊穣神の創造物である相手には、それも通じません。神が、自らの信徒に自分を殺す力を授けるはずがないでしょう。","source_cn":"但是，遇上同是丰饶神所创之物，它就会失去效用。神……不会赋予信徒能够杀死自己的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6DB88311B7A025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510332005:0":{"text":"ふん、あり得んな。ゼドラン様が我々に罰を与える理由がない。","source_cn":"哼，这不可能。赛图恩怎么会对呼临人施以惩罚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB040C5D4AA573E27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510332006:0":{"text":"あの方は慈愛深く、誰からも尊敬され、崇められる存在だ。","source_cn":"正因他慈爱可慕，所以才被世代敬仰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2526BDC9A2AEBA9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510332007:0":{"text":"ペルセウス、盲信に目を曇らせてはなりません。その目で見たでしょう。あなた方の命を脅かしているのは、豊穣神の眷族なのですよ。","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，别再让愚信蒙住双眼。你已经亲眼所见，丰饶神派...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x036B611B87F072FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510332008:0":{"text":"ホーリン城の飢饉は、豊穣神ゼドランが堕落した結果――","source_cn":"呼临城现在所面临的饥荒，更是丰饶神赛图恩堕落的结果——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBB3A3D530ACF9CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510332009:0":{"text":"もう十分だ。","source_cn":"——够了。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F1885F55BAF51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510332010:0":{"text":"あなたのことは尊敬している。だが、俺たちの信仰には干渉しないでほしい。","source_cn":"女士，我尊敬你。但不要置喙我们的信仰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51492A5D526CBEFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510332011:0":{"text":"この話は、ここで終わりだ。","source_cn":"今天的事就到此为止。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F7F6F05EC3DD1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510332012:0":{"text":"怖いのですね。","source_cn":"你怕了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x091F7EF0DC5691AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510332013:1":{"text":"メイジの言うことを認めるのが……","source_cn":"你怕这个魔法师说的是真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B9232FA96F7533E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510332014:0":{"text":"よく聞け、ヤクボルの獣人……神が堕落するというのなら、お前たちの狩猟神とて例外ではないのだぞ。","source_cn":"雅库伯尔人，如果神会堕落，你们的狩猎神未必不会！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x067405F3E488700F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"よく聞け、ヤクボルの獣人……神が堕落するというのなら、お前たちの狩猟神とて例外ではないのだぞ。","female":"よく聞け、ヤクボルの獣人……神が堕落するというのなら、お前たちの狩猟神とて例外ではないのだぞ。","variant_male_record_index":"179845","variant_female_record_index":"179846","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510332015:0":{"text":"狩猟神さまは大丈夫です。ガーラは知っています。","source_cn":"狩猎神大人不会。加拉知道。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC3B151408391964","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"狩猟神さまは大丈夫です。ガーラは知っています。","female":"狩猟神さまは大丈夫です。ガーラは知っています。","variant_male_record_index":"179847","variant_female_record_index":"179848","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510332016:0":{"text":"あなたが怖いのは、自分の神を信じられなくなっているから……","source_cn":"你害怕，因为你不再相信自己的神了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B5C63B880C52B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510332017:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x336E7D35A6BC283E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510332018:0":{"text":"この辺にしましょう、神使さん。これ以上、私たちにできることはありません。","source_cn":"就这样吧，小神使。我们能做的事已经做完了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0177816B122B0CB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510332019:0":{"text":"私はスピロクタスを調べます。狩猟神様と神使さんも手伝ってくれますか？","source_cn":"我要再对针蝗做一些调查，狩猎神和小神使，能否陪我一起呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAAC450DA1F4CCDB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"私はスピロクタスを調べます。狩猟神様と神使さんも手伝ってくれますか？","female":"私はスピロクタスを調べます。狩猟